        rules: {
          objective: 'Be the first team to reach target score (typically 2000-3000 points) by melding sequences, creating canastas (7+ card sequences), and going out. Score points from melded cards plus bonuses.',
          gameplay: 'Players draw and discard, melding sequences of 3+ consecutive cards of same suit. Wild cards (jokers/twos) can substitute. First player to empty hand takes a morto (11-card extra hand). Team can go out after taking morto and having at least one canastra. Play ends when team goes out or cards exhausted.',
          keyRules: [
            'Two 11-card mortos set aside for first players out',
