          deckDescription: 'Two standard 52-card decks combined (104 cards) plus four jokers (108 cards total). Four suits (spades, hearts, diamonds, clubs), thirteen ranks each in duplicate. Jokers and twos are wild; used for Buraco (rummy) with canastas and going out.',
          suitDescription: 'Four French suits (spades, hearts, diamonds, clubs) in duplicate. Sequences must be in the same suit; jokers and twos may substitute for any card. Sets are three or more of the same rank; canastas require seven cards.',
          rankDescription: 'Thirteen ranks per suit in each deck (ace through two). Jokers and twos are wild. Standard rummy ranking for sequences; the first to go out with valid melds (and optionally close the stock) wins the hand.',
